# Overview

包含Cast Engine大屏设备侧SDK中的类。

## Interface Summary

|Interface|Description|
|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:----------------------------|
|[IEventListener](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/ieventlistener-0000001051686905)|事件接收接口。主要包含连接请求及连接状态变化等消息的传递。|

## Class Summary

|Class|Description|
|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:------------------------------|
|[PlayerClient](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/playerclient-0000001052167790)|Cast Engine大屏设备侧实例。|
|[DeviceInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/deviceinfo-0000001052807802)|大屏端设备信息。如设备名、设备类型等。|
|[AuthInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/authinfo-0000001052449121)|设备鉴权模式信息。|
|[HiSightCapability](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/hisightcapability-0000001051609048)|投屏能力类。主要用于大屏侧APK配置大屏端设备支持的投屏能力。|
|[TrackControl](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/trackcontrol-0000001051449101)|音视频轨道控制信息。|
|[Event](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/event-0000001051449060)|事件类对象。|
|[ConnectRequestChoice](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/connectrequestchoice-0000001051767796)|连接请求确认结果类。|
|[DisplayInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/displayinfo-0000001059503858)|界面显示相关信息。|
|[Constant](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/connectivity-References/constant-0000001052527792)|消息常量类。|

